{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id42615592"}, "name":{"label":"Artist/Filmmaker"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-29T10:55:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.1"}, "id":{"label":"14241880885"}, "title":{"label":"Excellent Start ~ Needs Completing"}, "content":{"label":"It is my understanding that a search feature has been sought after, requested for at least three years. It truly is essential for a visual calendar, AI isn’t. Structured app as it is is a good start, visually pleasing, intuitive,  but isn’t complete. Setting times for events is rather laborious and the repeat feature needs more options such as “last Saturday of the month” as most basic calendars provide. A little more development and this would be a grand all in one calendar. It just isn’t quite there yet.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
