{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id473362128"}, "name":{"label":"Taylor2426"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-27T16:03:29-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.1"}, "id":{"label":"14234561115"}, "title":{"label":"Perfect!!! 😊"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve tried various apps for time management, tasks and scheduling and have been dissatisfied with all of them. This one is simple to use, accomplishes exactly what I need and has a great interface. I also love the energy leveling. It’s a fantastic idea where you can better analyze the mental load of your daily workload!\n\nIt’s super neat that it can also integrate into other apps such as awake and one sec. Makes it even easier to stay on track throughout the day and eliminate distractions. \n\nI also link that it offers a lifetime subscription. I’m tired of paying monthly fees for every app. The free subscription also has a lot to offer.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id436306870"}, "name":{"label":"Человек157336643"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-27T13:04:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.1"}, "id":{"label":"14234090342"}, "title":{"label":"Идеально!"}, "content":{"label":"Все очень нравится, но верните пожалуйста прошлый вариант настройки времени. Раньше в настройке времени при варианте стандарт, можно было двигать поминутно. Теперь шаг примерно в 15 минут появляется, стало жутко неудобно", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1343368325"}, "name":{"label":"Eric. Aren"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-27T08:36:32-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.1"}, "id":{"label":"14233246179"}, "title":{"label":"Worthless Now"}, "content":{"label":"Was excited for the AI features to help me import calendar and emails to immediately add them to my planner. But the ai feels so limited, can’t even do custom colors for tasks, and missed the point of the prompts I gave it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id223443800"}, "name":{"label":"Anappleaday2"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-26T07:13:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.1"}, "id":{"label":"14228816090"}, "title":{"label":"I like it!"}, "content":{"label":"It’s easy to use, works with all of my calendars, has updates so I know they’re continuing to improve, and the AI part writes my tasks out so I don’t have to think about it. Also, when AI writes my tasks, and it looks like I won’t be done until 11pm, I realize I’ve over tasked myself! Which is funny, but also reminds me that I cannot physically do all the things I think I should do in one day.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
